title: Payers › Arrive on the page
route: /payers
intro: How a person lands on Payers, which payer and tab they see first, what the badges count, and where each control on the page leads. Every other Payers diagram starts from one of the hand offs at the bottom.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click 'Payers' in the sidebar\nunder Connections"
start s2 "Open a link to one payer's Changes tab\nBell notification, FLO answer, Demo menu"
process p1 "Address is /payers\nNo payer, no tab"
process p2 "Address is /payers/cardinal?tab=changes"
decision d1 "Does the address name a known payer?"
process p3 "Use the first payer in the list\nSummit Medicaid HMO"
process p4 "Use the payer named in the address"
decision d2 "Is ?tab one of process,\nrules, documents, changes?"
process p5 "Show the Process tab"
process p6 "Show the tab named in the address"

screen pg "Payers\n'N payers. The agents know how each one works.'\nWorkflow, rules and documents for every payer. Every edit is logged with your reason."

group gL "Left column"
  screen list "Payer list card\n'Payers', 'Search payers', four groups, a dot per payer, legend"
  click c_pick "Click a payer in the list"
  click c_search "Type in 'Search payers'"
endgroup

group gR "Right column"
  screen head "Payer header\nName, plan line, 'Edit log', 'Edit', four facts"
  screen tabs "Tab bar\nProcess, Rules, Documents, Changes"
  click c_edit "Click 'Edit'"
  click c_log "Click 'Edit log'"
  click c_tab "Click a tab"
endgroup

click c_add "Click 'Add a payer'\ntop right of the page"

group gB "What the badges count"
  process b1 "Sidebar 'Payers' badge\nPayers with a change waiting\n3 at the start: Cardinal, Evergreen\nand Harborview. Falls when a change is updated"
  process b2 "'Changes' tab badge\nThe waiting change plus each Historian proposal\nFalls as each is handled"
endgroup

goto g_list "Continues in: Payers › List › Search and pick a payer"
goto g_head "Continues in: Payers › Header › What the facts mean"
goto g_edit "Continues in: Payers › Edit payer details"
goto g_log "Continues in: Payers › Edit log"
goto g_add "Continues in: Payers › Add a payer"
goto g_proc "Continues in: Payers › Process › Read the workflow"
goto g_rules "Continues in: Payers › Rules › Read the rules"
goto g_docs "Continues in: Payers › Documents › Read the document list"
goto g_chg "Continues in: Payers › Changes › Read what changed"

s1 --> p1 --> d1
s2 --> p2 --> d1
d1 -->|No, or an unknown id| p3 --> d2
d1 -->|Yes| p4 --> d2
d2 -->|No, or missing| p5 --> pg
d2 -->|Yes| p6 --> pg
pg --> list & head & tabs & c_add
pg -.-> b1
tabs -.-> b2
list --> c_pick & c_search
c_pick --> g_list
c_search --> g_list
head --> c_edit & c_log
head --> g_head
c_edit --> g_edit
c_log --> g_log
c_add --> g_add
tabs --> c_tab
c_tab -->|Process| g_proc
c_tab -->|Rules| g_rules
c_tab -->|Documents| g_docs
c_tab -->|Changes| g_chg
